Stage06 Demo01: stateful decoder ioctl sequence map
codec              : H264
capture_raw        : NV12
frames             : 4
source_change_at   : 3

id | userspace action                   | driver shadow                             | visible evidence
---+------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------+------------------------------
1  | open(/dev/videoX)                  | file_operations.open 创建 codec session  | fd >= 0
2  | VIDIOC_QUERYCAP                    | 驱动返回 capabilities                  | capabilities 含 M2M/STREAMING
3  | S_FMT OUTPUT H264                  | 压缩码流队列格式协商             | OUTPUT pixelformat=H264
4  | S_FMT CAPTURE NV12                 | 解码帧队列格式协商                | CAPTURE pixelformat=NV12
5  | REQBUFS/QUERYBUF/MMAP              | vb2 分配/准备 queue buffer             | 用户态获得 mmap 地址
6  | QBUF OUTPUT bytesused>0            | 压缩 packet 所有权交给驱动        | OUTPUT queued
7  | QBUF CAPTURE empty                 | 空 frame buffer 所有权交给驱动     | CAPTURE queued
8  | STREAMON both queues               | v4l2-mem2mem 可调度 job                 | streaming=on
9  | poll + DQBUF loop                  | IRQ/worker 完成后 wakeup                | DQBUF 返回 sequence/timestamp
10 | SOURCE_CHANGE                      | 驱动提示分辨率/stride 改变        | 需要重配 CAPTURE
11 | EOS/drain                          | 驱动排空内部 DPB/引用帧           | 最后一个 buffer 带 LAST
12 | STREAMOFF + munmap + close         | 停止硬件 job 并释放 session         | 资源对称释放

模拟 decode loop：
[frame 1] QBUF OUTPUT compressed_packet bytesused>0 -> DRIVER
[frame 1] QBUF CAPTURE empty_frame_buffer -> DRIVER
[frame 1] poll waits for driver wakeup
[frame 1] DQBUF OUTPUT done + DQBUF CAPTURE decoded_frame -> USER
[frame 2] QBUF OUTPUT compressed_packet bytesused>0 -> DRIVER
[frame 2] QBUF CAPTURE empty_frame_buffer -> DRIVER
[frame 2] poll waits for driver wakeup
[frame 2] DQBUF OUTPUT done + DQBUF CAPTURE decoded_frame -> USER
[frame 3] QBUF OUTPUT compressed_packet bytesused>0 -> DRIVER
[frame 3] QBUF CAPTURE empty_frame_buffer -> DRIVER
[frame 3] poll waits for driver wakeup
[frame 3] EVENT SOURCE_CHANGE: STREAMOFF CAPTURE -> REQBUFS new size -> STREAMON CAPTURE
[frame 3] DQBUF OUTPUT done + DQBUF CAPTURE decoded_frame -> USER
[frame 4] QBUF OUTPUT compressed_packet bytesused>0 -> DRIVER
[frame 4] QBUF CAPTURE empty_frame_buffer -> DRIVER
[frame 4] poll waits for driver wakeup
[frame 4] DQBUF OUTPUT done + DQBUF CAPTURE decoded_frame -> USER

关键计数器：
qbuf_output                  = 4
qbuf_capture                 = 4
dqbuf_output                 = 4
dqbuf_capture                = 4
poll_calls                   = 4
timeout_count                = 0
source_change_count          = 1
eos_count                    = 1
recovery_count               = 1

verdict=SEQUENCE_MAP_READY
下一步：运行 02_format_negotiation_probe，观察 TRY_FMT/S_FMT 如何把请求格式变成驱动接受的格式。
